{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1.0.0 Version of the game has below Content</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >160,000+ words of total dialogue</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6,000+ images</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >380 animation / video files</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >21,000+ SFX &amp; audio files</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40,000+ lines of custom code</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 girls who you can add to your hareem after completing all their side quest</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some NPCs and Locations are Under construction.. will be added with future updates.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Altho this is not Labeled as Early Access game but treat it as Early access <br>NSFW games are hard to be in Early access these days with new  rules...\u00a0<br><br>Game will get updated every 3 month and will get more NPCS + Side quests<br> ( Players feedback will play huge role in which character get their story advanced )</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try not to be abusive please &lt;3. discord is active and we are replying and trying our best... Thank you</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2655080/extras/40ffaa54f10d2d8b9e67c2229d6a650c.avif?t=1772085306\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2655080/extras/8d17d4b66c4ca3fdf85c517a37b544c1.poster.avif?t=1772085306\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2655080/extras/8d17d4b66c4ca3fdf85c517a